{
  "name": "tags",
  "rule": "the Tag (web-only): does an h1, an h2, a p, or a Group's section, nav or span move a box? The browser gives h1-h6 and p margins of their own, and the runtime's sheet resets a Text's (.ndl-visual-text { margin: 0 })",
